note Selected native expert window. cfg tokens,rows,H,EI,mutant,scale. VAs xp,gu,act,actp,dn,xmap,ymap,sgu,sdn,xout,ptH,ptEI. Window offsets follow moe_windows.
fn mg_win c view ulong 16 v view ulong 16 w view ulong 8 d edit ulong 64 p ulong to ulong
a = new ulong 16 0
for i ulong 64
put d i 0
end
if ge p 6
put d 0 255
ret 1
end
put d 2 1
put d 3 1
put d 4 get c 1
if eq p 0
put d 0 46
put d 5 15
ret 1
end
if or eq p 2 eq p 5
put d 0 35
put d 7 get c 1
put d 8 get c 1
put d 10 get v 7
put d 11 add get v 0 get w 3
put d 12 add get v 1 get w 4
put d 13 get v 5
put d 14 get v 6
if eq p 5
put d 0 38
put d 15 1
put d 10 get v 8
put d 11 add get v 3 get w 5
put d 12 add get v 4 get w 6
put d 13 get v 6
end
ret 1
end
if eq p 3
put d 0 36
put d 1 3
put d 5 5
if eq get c 4 1
put d 1 20
end
put d 2 div get c 3 256
put d 3 get c 1
put d 4 mul get c 1 get c 3
put a 0 add get v 1 get w 4
put a 1 add get v 2 get w 5
put a 2 get c 5
ret gr_pack a d 2
end
put d 0 34
put d 1 11
put d 2 div add get c 2 255 256
put d 3 get c 0
put d 4 mul get c 0 get c 2
put a 0 add get v 9 get w 7
put d 5 6
put a 1 get v 10
put a 2 add get v 0 get w 3
if eq p 4
put d 0 37
put d 1 12
put d 2 div add get c 3 255 256
put d 3 get c 1
put d 4 mul get c 1 get c 3
put a 0 add get v 2 get w 5
put a 1 get v 11
put a 2 add get v 3 get w 5
end
ret gr_pack a d 4
end
